{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-1","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Vanities in divine service; 8 in murmuring against oppression; 9 and in riches. 18 Joy in riches is the gift of God.</p>\n<p>thy foot. Ge 28:16,17; Ex 3:5; Le 10:3; Jos 5:15; 2Ch 26:16; Ps 89:7 Isa 1:12-20; 1Co 11:22; Heb 12:28,29 ready. Ac 10:33; 17:11; Jas 1:19; 1Pe 2:1,2 give. Ge 4:3-5; 1Sa 13:12,13; 15:21,22; Ps 50:8-18; Pr 15:8; 21:27 Isa 1:12-15; 66:3; Jer 7:21-23; Ho 6:6,7; Mal 1:10,11; Heb 10:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-2","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>not rash. Ge 18:27,30,32; 28:20,22; Nu 30:2-5; Jud 11:30; 1Sa 14:24-45 Mr 6:23 thing. or, word. for. Ps 115:3; Isa 55:9; Mt 6:9 let thy . 3,7; Pr 10:19; Mt 6:7; Jas 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-3","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>a fool's. 10:12-14; Pr 10:19; 15:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-4","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>vowest. Ge 28:20; 35:1,3; Nu 30:2; De 23:21-23; Ps 50:14; 76:11; 119:106 Isa 19:21; Mt 5:33 for. Ps 147:10,11; Mal 1:10; Heb 10:6 pay. Ps 66:13,14; 116:14,16-18; Jon 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-5","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>De 23:22; Pr 20:25; Ac 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-6","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>thy mouth. 1,2; Jas 1:26; 3:2 before.Or, \"before the messenger,\" {hammalach,} the priest whose business it was to take cognizance of vows and offerings.</p>\n<p>Le 5:4,5; Ge 48:16; Ho 12:4,5; Mal 2:7; 3:1; Ac 7:30-35; 1Co 11:10 1Ti 5:21; Heb 1:14 it was. Le 5:4-6; 27:9,10 destroy. Hag 1:9-11; 2:14-17; 1Co 3:13-15; 2Jo 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-7","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>in the. 3; Mt 12:36 but. 7:18; 8:12; 12:13; Pr 23:17; Isa 50:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-8","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>thou seest. 3:16; 4:1; Ps 12:5; 55:9; 58:11; Pr 8:17; Hab 1:2,3,13 marvel. Zec 8:6; 1Jo 3:13; Re 17:6,7 matter. Heb. will, or purpose. Isa 10:5-7,12; 46:10,11; Hab 1:12; Ac 4:27,28; Ro 11:33 for. Isa 57:15; Lu 1:32,35,76 regardeth. 1Ki 21:19,20; Job 20:19-29; 27:8-23; Ps 10:17,18; 12:5; 58:10,11 Ps 82:1; 83:18; 140:11,12; Isa 3:15; 5:7; 59:13-16; Jer 22:17-19 Eze 22:6-14; Am 5:12; 6:2-6,12; 8:4-7; Mic 2:1-3,9; 3:1-4,9-12 Mic 6:10-13; Zec 7:9-13; Mal 3:5; Jas 2:13; 5:2-7 higher than they. 1Ch 21:15,16; Ps 95:3; Isa 37:36; Mt 13:41,42; Ac 12:7-10,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-9","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the profit. Ge 1:29,30; 3:17-19; Ps 104:14,15; 115:16; Pr 13:23; 27:23-27 Pr 28:19; Jer 40:10-12 the king. 1Sa 8:12-17; 1Ki 4:7-23; 1Ch 27:26-31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-10","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>He that.The more he gets, the more he would get; for {Crescit amor nummi, quantum ipsa pecunia crescit,} \"The love of money increases, in proportion as money itself increases.\"</p>\n<p>4:8; 6:7; Ps 52:1,7; 62:10; Pr 30:15,16; Hab 2:5-7; Mt 6:19,24 Lu 12:15; 1Ti 6:10 this. 1:17; 2:11,17,18,26; 3:19; 4:4,8,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-11","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>they. Ge 12:16; 13:2,5-7; 1Ki 4:22,23; 5:13-16; Ne 5:17,18; Ps 119:36,37 what. 6:9; 11:9; Jos 7:21-25; Pr 23:5; Jer 17:11; Hab 2:13; 1Jo 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-12","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ps 4:8; 127:2; Pr 3:24; Jer 31:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-13","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>a sore. 4:8; 6:1,2 riches. 8:9; Ge 13:5-11; 14:16; 19:14,26,31-38; Pr 1:11-13,19,32 Pr 11:4,24,25; Isa 2:20; 32:6-8; Zep 1:18; Lu 12:16-21 Lu 16:1-13,19,22,23; 18:22,23; 19:8; 1Ti 6:9,10; Jas 2:5-7; 5:1-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-14","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>those. 2:26; Job 5:5; 20:15-29; 27:16,17; Ps 39:6; Pr 23:5; Hag 1:9 Hag 2:16,17; Mt 6:19,20 and he. 1Sa 2:6-8,36; 1Ki 14:26; Ps 109:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-15","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Job 1:21; Ps 49:17; Lu 12:20; 1Ti 6:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-16","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a sore. 13; 2:22,23 what. 1Sa 12:21; Jer 2:8; Mr 8:36 for. 1:3; Pr 11:29; Isa 26:18; Ho 8:7; Joh 6:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-17","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>he eateth. Ge 3:17; 1Ki 17:12; Job 21:25; Ps 78:33; 102:9; 127:2; Eze 4:16,17 much. 2Ki 1:2,6; 5:27; 2Ch 16:10-12; 24:24,25; Ps 90:7-11; Pr 1:27-29 Ac 12:23; 1Co 11:30-32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-18","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>it is good and comely. Heb. there is a good which is comely,etc. 2:24; 3:12,13,22; 8:15; 9:7; 11:9; 1Ti 6:17 the days. Heb. the number of the days. it is his. 2:10; 3:22; Jer 52:34</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-19","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>to whom. 2:24; 3:13; 6:2; De 8:18; 1Ki 3:13 this is. 2:24-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ecc-5-20","title":"Ecclesiastes 5:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ECC","chapterStart":5,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":5,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>For he shall not much remember. or, Though he give not much,yet he rembemereth, etc. Ps 37:16 because. De 28:8-12,47; Ps 4:6,7; Isa 64:5; 65:13,14,21-24; Ro 5:1,5-11</p>"}]}